# Package only runtime assets and public documentation.
# README.md is intentionally NOT allow-listed here: `npm run package` passes
# --readme-path MARKETPLACE.md, which vsce writes into the package's own
# readme.md slot. Bundling README.md too would collide with it (VSIX is a
# case-insensitive zip) and would leak dev-only content into the install.
**/*
!package.json
!CHANGELOG.md
!SECURITY_REVIEW.md
!LICENSE
!dist/extension.js
!media/icon.svg
!media/marketplace-icon.png
!prompts/code-review.md
!prompts/security-review.md
!prompts/performance-review.md
